# Live install is opt-in

Work only in this repo (`~/GitHub/ai-sub-monitor`, GitHub: `spenceriam/ai-sub-plugin`).

Do not rsync/cp into `~/.config/omarchy/plugins/io.github.spenceriam.ai-sub-monitor/` and do not run `omarchy plugin enable` or `rescanPlugins` unless the current message says to install or deploy.

`omarchy plugin validate` against **this** folder is allowed. Collectors may be run from this folder. They must not write into `~/.config/omarchy/`.
